# BOOST rover: the LEGO BOOST blocks (legoboostunified) drive the Move Hub's built-in motors A and B
# ahead for three seconds, then turn the rover on wheel A by 540 degrees. Each motor gets its own
# block: the extension sends one message per 50 ms, so a block for "AB" reaches motor A only.
WHEN flag clicked:
  boost set motor A power to 100 %
  boost set motor B power to 100 %
  boost turn motor A on
  boost turn motor B on
  wait 3 seconds
  boost turn motor A off
  boost turn motor B off
  boost turn motor A on for 540 degrees
